Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 06:15:47 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] A staff stays in hand through a spell's cast (patch 0045)

A unit flagged by SetUnitMissileOrigin(unit, "weapon") keeps its weapon drawn through a clip whose
WeaponFlags would stow it (a spell cast's), unless mounted or put away by choice: the Mage holds
the staff out the whole cast (Corey's playtest, Nov 5). HasActionCombat() says 25.
